# CSCI 4380 Database Systems, Fall 2026 (Sibel Adali's syllabus)
#
# To pass you need an average of 60 across the midterms and the final,
# whatever your homework and exercises are. Cutoffs are applied without rounding.
course CSCI 4380 Database Systems
scale A 93, A- 90, B+ 87, B 83, B- 80, C+ 77, C 73, C- 70, D+ 67, D 60
require exams >= 60 rounded

# Exercises can't be made up, but extra ones replace missed or low ones
# (not modelled: add them as items). n= is a guess; change it as the term goes.
category Lecture Exercises 30% n=24
category Homework 26% n=8
category Midterm 1 14% group=exams
  Midterm 1 -
category Midterm 2 14% group=exams
  Midterm 2 -
category Final Exam 16% group=exams
  Final -
